The '''Hamster Wheel''' is a {{Rare}} [[Minion Fuel]] that is an {{Odds|occasional}} drop from the [[Sven Packmaster]] at {{SlayerTier|2}} or higher. It boosts the speed of a [[Minions|Minion]] by {{Green|50%}} for 1 day.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
The '''Hamster Wheel''' drops from the [[Sven Packmaster]] at {{SlayerTier|2}} or higher.
*{{SlayerTier|2}}: {{Green|16.67%}} chance to obtain 1 Hamster Wheel
*{{SlayerTier|3}}: {{Green|16.59%}} chance to obtain 2-4 Hamster Wheels
*{{SlayerTier|4}}: {{Green|16.49%}} chance to obtain 4-5 Hamster Wheels

== Usage ==
=== Minion Fuel ===
The '''Hamster Wheel''' boosts the speed of a [[Minions|Minion]] by {{Green|50%}} for 1 day. {{Affected Minions List|fuel|all}}

